    },
    turnFlow: 'Deal six cards each in packets of three and turn up the next card for proposed trump. If the non-dealer accepts, play proceeds. If the non-dealer begs, the dealer either gifts one point and throws in the hand immediately, or runs cards by dealing three more each and turning again until trump suit changes. In trick play, players may always play trump, but cannot play off-suit non-trump when able to follow suit. Highest trump wins; if no trump is played, highest of led suit wins. After play, score points in order High, Low, Jack, Game.',
